  "releaseNotes": "Actively maintained fork of the EntitySpaces ORM, modernized for .NET Framework 4.8 through .NET 10 and aligned with EntitySpaces Studio 2026.11.\n\nSQL Server: OUTPUT INSERTED for all server-generated columns in a single round-trip, SET XACT_ABORT ON on generated statements, full concurrency exception translation (532, 547, 1205, 1222, 2601, 2627) and Microsoft.Data.SqlClient for SQL Server 2016-2025.\n\nFull release notes: https://github.com/paulcordova/EntitySpaces/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
